00:32:28.447 --> 00:32:30.073
Please send him to the hospital

551
00:32:30.157 --> 00:32:31.032
- OK
- thank you

552
00:32:51.219 --> 00:32:52.846
thank you

553
00:32:57.559 --> 00:32:58.477
thank you

554
00:32:58.560 --> 00:33:00.353
Good bye

555
00:33:14.034 --> 00:33:16.870
(Executive Director Lee Han Na)

556
00:33:23.585 --> 00:33:24.836
dad

557
00:33:27.255 --> 00:33:28.590
Are you going to a funeral?

558
00:33:29.799 --> 00:33:30.675
No

559
00:33:30.759 --> 00:33:32.719
Can you give me a ride?

560
00:33:37.015 --> 00:33:40.685
Just an interview with a college tutor
Do you go out of your way to wear formal clothes?

561
00:33:40.769 --> 00:33:42.312
No, just...

562
00:33:42.812 --> 00:33:45.732
I heard that the interviewer is from the human resources team of a large company.

563
00:33:46.525 --> 00:33:47.817
Why are you like this suddenly?

564
00:33:50.320 --> 00:33:52.197
I need to gain more experience, Dad.

565
00:33:53.698 --> 00:33:55.408
I don't know what I like yet

566
00:33:55.492 --> 00:33:58.119
What kind of person do you want to be?

567
00:34:01.248 --> 00:34:02.916
Do you need experience?

568
00:34:05.001 --> 00:34:07.003
you read it again

569
00:34:07.087 --> 00:34:09.172
Been to a startup company

570
00:34:10.215 --> 00:34:11.716
Even been cheated

571
00:34:12.801 --> 00:34:15.929
Also opened an online store
What 20-something has done so much?

572
00:34:17.597 --> 00:34:21.059
Let me tell you, you have enough experience

573
00:34:21.142 --> 00:34:24.448
Is there anything you like about these experiences?

574
00:34:25.855 --> 00:34:27.315
Yes, but...

575
00:34:27.399 --> 00:34:28.358
Right?

576
00:34:29.025 --> 00:34:30.569
So what is there to be uncertain about?

577
00:34:31.194 --> 00:34:34.197
Just start there, kid.

578
00:34:35.699 --> 00:34:37.576
Why make things so complicated?

579
00:34:45.750 --> 00:34:46.710
Kim Soo Kyum?

580
00:34:47.377 --> 00:34:48.295
What?

581
00:34:48.378 --> 00:34:50.505
This is the Kim Soo Kyum I remember

582
00:34:51.089 --> 00:34:55.468
There is rebellion hidden in his bones
But he is a strict boy who abides by the rules.

583
00:34:55.552 --> 00:34:57.220
We work well together, right?

584
00:34:57.304 --> 00:35:00.932
Why don't we buy some goods?
Seriously, start selling, right?

585
00:35:01.558 --> 00:35:04.811
Do you want to take these pictures?
On our hoodies?

586
00:35:05.520 --> 00:35:08.648
I can't do anything without you

587
00:35:09.149 --> 00:35:10.984
you let me

588
00:35:11.067 --> 00:35:14.613
want to be a better person

589
00:35:15.655 --> 00:35:18.074
Anyway, you can always figure it out on your own in the end.

590
00:35:22.255 --> 00:35:23.413
(Hannah)

591
00:35:23.496 --> 00:35:27.042
I'm at the airport
Take care of yourself when I'm not around

592
00:35:31.296 --> 00:35:33.506
Dad, can you stop over there?

593
00:35:37.260 --> 00:35:38.345
I'll contact you later, Dad.

594
00:35:38.428 --> 00:35:39.346
Yeah

595
00:35:39.888 --> 00:35:41.014
thank you

596
00:35:47.896 --> 00:35:49.898
(taxi)

597
00:35:50.606 --> 00:35:51.524
hello

598
00:36:04.371 --> 00:36:05.330
thank you

599
00:36:12.212 --> 00:36:14.047
Dear passengers, please note

600
00:36:14.673 --> 00:36:16.549
According to aviation safety regulations

601
00:36:16.633 --> 00:36:19.177
International flights

602
00:36:19.678 --> 00:36:21.304
You are not allowed to carry it in your carry-on luggage...

603
00:36:21.388 --> 00:36:22.931
(Han Na, where are you? Wait for me)

604
00:36:23.014 --> 00:36:24.641
...liquids and gels

605
00:37:18.945 --> 00:37:20.280
I've been looking for you everywhere

606
00:37:36.129 --> 00:37:37.922
Did you take a taxi again?

607
00:37:44.012 --> 00:37:45.221
What are you here for?

608
00:37:47.849 --> 00:37:49.768
I really have to go now

609
00:37:52.479 --> 00:37:53.480
i know

610
00:37:55.356 --> 00:37:56.608
Ah I...

611
00:38:03.281 --> 00:38:04.741
i like you

612
00:38:39.651 --> 00:38:40.777
take it

613
00:38:45.532 --> 00:38:46.741
What are you doing?

614
00:38:46.825 --> 00:38:48.243
Sorry

615
00:38:50.662 --> 00:38:52.455
I suddenly realized

616
00:38:53.081 --> 00:38:55.708
The lighting in your office is so nice

617
00:38:56.793 --> 00:39:00.964
I'm thinking it would be nice if I could put potted flowers by the window.

618
00:39:35.248 --> 00:39:36.708
(Executive personnel appointments in 2025)

619
00:39:36.791 --> 00:39:38.543
(Announcement time changed to 2pm today)

620
00:39:43.339 --> 00:39:44.591
(Executive Director Bai Zhengtai)

621
00:40:11.436 --> 00:40:12.994
- I'm going out first
- Yeah

622
00:40:13.077 --> 00:40:14.454
Yes, yesterday

623
00:40:15.038 --> 00:40:16.873
I received some medicine and fruit gift boxes

624
00:40:17.957 --> 00:40:19.876
- What?
- Sent by the customer

625
00:40:19.959 --> 00:40:21.961
I put it in the pantry. Let's take it and eat it.

626
00:40:23.087 --> 00:40:25.548
Thank you, Minister. I will enjoy it.

627
00:40:25.632 --> 00:40:28.051
Take a box and give it to Minister Kim.

628
00:40:28.843 --> 00:40:30.303
- Minister Kim?
- Right

629
00:40:30.386 --> 00:40:31.763
he is nearby

630
00:40:33.264 --> 00:40:36.142
Also tell me if he is happy to receive the gift

631
00:40:38.144 --> 00:40:39.354
thank you

632
00:40:49.864 --> 00:40:53.076
I have to go pre-wash that car.

633
00:41:04.212 --> 00:41:05.129
What's wrong?

634
00:41:05.713 --> 00:41:07.632
If you have anything to say, just say it. I'm busy.

635
00:41:10.301 --> 00:41:11.928
I really don't understand

636
00:41:12.595 --> 00:41:13.554
What?

637
00:41:13.638 --> 00:41:15.848
What Executive Bai asked Minister you to do

638
00:41:16.557 --> 00:41:18.309
Is it harder than this?

639
00:41:19.143 --> 00:41:21.896
If you want to work secretly while wearing a mask

640
00:41:21.980 --> 00:41:23.189
That's not as good as...

641
00:41:26.734 --> 00:41:27.944
sorry

642
00:41:29.529 --> 00:41:30.405
Is that okay?

643
00:41:32.824 --> 00:41:35.034
Du Zhenyu knows that you work here, Minister

644
00:41:35.868 --> 00:41:38.830
He asked me to give this to you

645
00:41:41.582 --> 00:41:42.625
You won't accept it, right?

646
00:41:44.210 --> 00:41:45.712
I just said you didn’t take it

647
00:41:46.695 --> 00:41:47.672
What?

648
00:41:48.605 --> 00:41:49.549
medicinal fruit

649
00:41:51.092 --> 00:41:52.218
It should be delicious. Leave it there.

650
00:41:55.096 --> 00:41:56.305
Let it go

651
00:42:06.190 --> 00:42:08.026
I just said you didn’t take it

652
00:42:08.109 --> 00:42:09.819
Why are you worrying about my face?

653
00:42:09.902 --> 00:42:11.320
I don't know either

654
00:42:12.405 --> 00:42:14.365
I just hope you don't accept it

655
00:42:14.449 --> 00:42:17.201
I don’t want to see you being teased by Du Zhenyu

656
00:42:17.285 --> 00:42:18.411
It turns out you...

657
00:42:19.162 --> 00:42:20.204
She quite likes me

658
00:42:21.088 --> 00:42:22.297
Yeah, probably so

659
00:42:23.376 --> 00:42:25.334
The list of senior executives will be announced soon

660
00:42:25.418 --> 00:42:27.670
starting from tomorrow
You really have to help Du Zhenyu clean the car.

661
00:42:27.754 --> 00:42:29.422
Can you really keep doing this?

662
00:42:32.341 --> 00:42:33.342
Naruhisa

663
00:42:34.218 --> 00:42:37.087
Don’t you go to work when you wake up in a bad mood?

664
00:42:39.182 --> 00:42:40.600
What kind of problem is this?

665
00:42:41.792 --> 00:42:42.793
Huh?

666
00:42:43.886 --> 00:42:45.138
Go about your business

667
00:42:49.692 --> 00:42:50.568
Good

668
00:43:12.673 --> 00:43:14.842
There's only one minute left until the announcement.

669
00:43:15.676 --> 00:43:17.678
Why are you more excited than me?

670
00:43:18.346 --> 00:43:19.764
55, 54...

671
00:43:19.847 --> 00:43:21.474
- Go to work
- ...53...

672
00:43:21.557 --> 00:43:23.851
- let's go
- ...52, 51, 50

673
00:43:24.852 --> 00:43:26.729
49, 48

674
00:43:26.813 --> 00:43:29.649
47, 46, 45

675
00:43:30.191 --> 00:43:31.818
44, 43...

676
00:43:32.443 --> 00:43:34.362
Personnel appointments are out

677
00:43:38.491 --> 00:43:41.119
(Organizational adjustment of sales department and appointment of senior management personnel)

678
00:44:03.891 --> 00:44:05.935
Luo Su, what are you doing?

679
00:44:06.435 --> 00:44:08.062
Come on, finish this quickly

680
00:44:08.146 --> 00:44:10.189
OK I'm here

681
00:44:35.798 --> 00:44:37.300
- Boss?
- Yeah

682
00:44:38.134 --> 00:44:39.218
This month’s evaluation form

683
00:44:42.185 --> 00:44:44.098
- Thank you for your hard work
- You too

684
00:44:44.182 --> 00:44:45.308
Luo Su, what's wrong?

685
00:44:48.227 --> 00:44:49.770
(Car wash service written evaluation form)

686
00:44:50.813 --> 00:44:51.981
Is this a good review?

687
00:44:52.064 --> 00:44:52.982
(satisfied)

688
00:44:53.065 --> 00:44:55.234
If it is considered an A based on performance evaluation
Of course it's not bad

689
00:44:55.818 --> 00:44:57.778
I used to give you an A all the time.

690
00:45:00.489 --> 00:45:03.451
Ah, then let’s work harder? We have to renew the contract.

691
00:45:03.534 --> 00:45:05.494
- Right
- Sorry, I have to go.

692
00:45:05.578 --> 00:45:07.205
- Come on, you're going to be late.
- Right

693
00:45:08.414 --> 00:45:12.084
Hey, wife, I'm leaving now, right?

694
00:45:21.928 --> 00:45:23.846
("The Way Back")

695
00:45:37.777 --> 00:45:39.438
...street

696
00:45:39.528 --> 00:45:43.199
I'm alone, waiting sadly

697
00:45:43.282 --> 00:45:47.078
Let the cold wind and rain

698
00:45:47.161 --> 00:45:50.164
slap my cheek

699
00:45:51.709 --> 00:45:57.463
Even though I can't say I love you

700
00:45:58.547 --> 00:46:04.971
- It's time to...
- It’s time to say goodbye softly

701
00:46:06.222 --> 00:46:11.102
People who leave without saying goodbye...

702
00:46:12.019 --> 00:46:13.187
Why turn it off?

703
00:46:13.271 --> 00:46:15.231
I hate it when people sing along with me

704
00:46:17.692 --> 00:46:19.652
It's because I'm the one singing it, right?

705
00:46:20.695 --> 00:46:22.613
I can see you at KTV and Mr. Bai...

706
00:46:26.158 --> 00:46:27.576
We have sung together several times

707
00:46:29.287 --> 00:46:31.289
You've been drinking. Have you hired a driver?

708
00:46:31.372 --> 00:46:32.748
called

709
00:46:32.832 --> 00:46:34.667
Okay, you go home

710
00:46:37.420 --> 00:46:39.547
You were supposed to wash my car that day

711
00:46:43.634 --> 00:46:46.345
I told you I needed some luck

712
00:46:52.545 --> 00:46:53.686
I didn't get promoted

713
00:46:57.356 --> 00:46:59.525
I am driving on behalf of you. Who is going to Banpo-dong?

714
00:47:00.151 --> 00:47:02.153
It's me. Why are you here so late?

715
00:47:02.778 --> 00:47:05.364
Sorry, the entrance is too hard to find.

716
00:47:06.866 --> 00:47:07.825
I called you a long time ago. Really?

717
00:47:10.152 --> 00:47:11.362
Give me the car keys quickly

718
00:47:12.955 --> 00:47:13.873
thank you

719
00:47:14.457 --> 00:47:15.958
Where is the car parked?

720
00:47:16.459 --> 00:47:17.752
Just press the key and look for it.

721
00:47:17.835 --> 00:47:19.253
I drank too much and I can’t remember clearly.

722
00:47:26.427 --> 00:47:28.304
Sorry, please call someone else.

723
00:47:28.846 --> 00:47:29.764
What does it mean?

724
00:47:29.847 --> 00:47:32.767
From my experience
I'm afraid this order won't be too pleasant.

725
00:47:33.267 --> 00:47:34.352
take care

726
00:47:35.019 --> 00:47:36.771
Wait, hey

727
00:47:36.854 --> 00:47:38.439
- Hey wait!
- Hello!

728
00:47:38.939 --> 00:47:40.024
- Don't do this
- Where are you going?

729
00:47:40.107 --> 00:47:41.567
That's enough, don't do this

730
00:47:42.318 --> 00:47:44.362
Isn’t that outrageous?

731
00:47:45.029 --> 00:47:46.947
Did I make some huge mistake?

732
00:47:48.074 --> 00:47:50.117
That has to be judged by others.

733
00:47:54.955 --> 00:47:56.374
Yes you are right

734
00:48:01.045 --> 00:48:03.881
It's not up to me to make the judgment.

735
00:48:09.804 --> 00:48:11.764
You can call a driver or just figure it out yourself.

736
00:48:11.847 --> 00:48:12.890
I'm busy

737
00:48:12.973 --> 00:48:14.141
Good

738
00:48:24.944 --> 00:48:26.237
Senior

739
00:48:28.572 --> 00:48:31.075
Why don't you think I was promoted?

740
00:48:33.369 --> 00:48:35.037
Did Special Agent Huang Taishan change his mind?

741
00:48:35.121 --> 00:48:38.499
Or did other committee members object?

742
00:48:40.042 --> 00:48:41.460
Or rather

743
00:48:42.044 --> 00:48:44.004
Do they think I'm too young to be an executive?

744
00:48:45.756 --> 00:48:47.216
If it's not that, it must be because

745
00:48:48.050 --> 00:48:49.927
I graduated from a junior college?

746
00:48:51.637 --> 00:48:53.013
Senior

747
00:48:56.100 --> 00:48:58.602
Why on earth didn't I get promoted?

748
00:48:59.687 --> 00:49:01.730
Why?

749
00:49:03.232 --> 00:49:05.359
Senior, you know the company very well

750
00:49:06.193 --> 00:49:07.278
Why should I...

751
00:49:07.361 --> 00:49:09.405
Why didn't I get promoted?

752
00:49:09.488 --> 00:49:10.948
I really can't figure it out

753
00:49:11.949 --> 00:49:13.409
After I joined the company

754
00:49:13.492 --> 00:49:16.745
All I think about every day is performance!

755
00:49:19.039 --> 00:49:20.332
I...

756
00:49:24.712 --> 00:49:27.214
I dedicated 19 years to ACT

757
00:49:31.844 --> 00:49:34.096
Logically speaking, it should be my turn no matter what.

758
00:49:35.347 --> 00:49:38.017
Become a senior executive for once?

759
00:49:43.772 --> 00:49:44.857
Yes

760
00:49:48.861 --> 00:49:49.778
Then why...

761
00:49:53.115 --> 00:49:54.283
Why on earth!

762
00:49:55.910 --> 00:49:57.870
There are no competitors. Why?

763
00:50:33.155 --> 00:50:35.449
Executive Bai extended his term for one year

764
00:50:37.159 --> 00:50:40.371
Maybe he will do the same to you
Send me to the factory

765
00:50:44.124 --> 00:50:45.709
Probably not

766
00:50:46.818 --> 00:50:47.920
Why?

767
00:50:48.003 --> 00:50:50.923
I have to rely on you to promote Executive Bai to Special Agent.

768
00:50:52.049 --> 00:50:55.553
This is how companies take advantage of you and him

769
00:50:57.596 --> 00:51:00.057
I no longer want to work for a company that takes advantage of me like this

770
00:51:00.140 --> 00:51:01.100
Then resign, boy.

771
00:51:01.892 --> 00:51:03.185
Isn’t your family quite rich?

772
00:51:04.603 --> 00:51:06.230
That apartment is not mine

773
00:51:06.939 --> 00:51:08.857
It's in the name of my father-in-law and mother-in-law

774
00:51:09.984 --> 00:51:11.193
That's right

775
00:51:12.611 --> 00:51:13.821
No wonder

776
00:51:15.823 --> 00:51:17.116
So that's it

777
00:51:18.867 --> 00:51:19.743
Oops

778
00:51:21.287 --> 00:51:23.872
This is like the Minister Kim Nak-soo I know

779
00:51:24.707 --> 00:51:25.583
What, you boy?

780
00:51:25.666 --> 00:51:27.167
It was nothing like it before

781
00:51:27.960 --> 00:51:29.128
to be honest

782
00:51:30.504 --> 00:51:33.215
I didn't get promoted to executive
I thought you would be happy

783
00:51:38.887 --> 00:51:41.181
I'm secretly looking forward to wiping your car

784
00:51:42.766 --> 00:51:46.270
I was thinking that
Maybe I'll feel a little relieved

785
00:51:47.396 --> 00:51:48.897
It's a pity you didn't get promoted

786
00:51:54.862 --> 00:51:56.614
How have you been since leaving your job?

787
00:51:58.407 --> 00:52:02.077
what on earth did you go through
Why would you say something like that?

788
00:52:09.043 --> 00:52:10.377
Sorry

789
00:52:10.961 --> 00:52:14.340
But our relationship
It seems like you’re not at the point where you can talk about this, right?

790
00:52:16.884 --> 00:52:18.010
Yes

791
00:52:18.552 --> 00:52:22.473
(Banpo Bridge Welcome to Seocho-gu)

792
00:52:37.613 --> 00:52:38.656
Goodbye

793
00:52:40.949 --> 00:52:42.368
Senior

794
00:52:54.213 --> 00:52:55.255
give

795
00:53:07.309 --> 00:53:08.686
Senior, why...

796
00:53:10.646 --> 00:53:12.856
Why didn't I get promoted?

797
00:53:25.703 --> 00:53:27.538
Why do you want to be an executive?

798
00:53:30.040 --> 00:53:30.916
What?

799
00:53:30.999 --> 00:53:33.127
Don't ask why you didn't get it

800
00:53:34.420 --> 00:53:36.505
Think about why you work so hard

801
00:53:36.588 --> 00:53:38.716
What is the purpose of living like this?

802
00:53:39.383 --> 00:53:40.509
Do you understand?

803
00:53:50.978 --> 00:53:51.854
Zhenyu

804
00:53:54.606 --> 00:53:56.817
Try to be honest with yourself

805
00:53:58.736 --> 00:54:00.612
Life would be easier that way

806
00:54:04.450 --> 00:54:05.534
Oh and...

807
00:54:09.121 --> 00:54:10.998
this is what i deserve

808
00:54:22.050 --> 00:54:23.177
I lost

809
00:54:25.095 --> 00:54:26.263
I lost

810
00:54:43.280 --> 00:54:45.491
Du Zhenyu did not resign

811
00:54:46.533 --> 00:54:49.828
as i expected
Bai Zhengtai didn't transfer him to the factory either.

812
00:54:50.662 --> 00:54:51.830
Is this possible?

813
00:54:54.374 --> 00:54:58.086
between two people
It is a relationship that has to depend on each other.

814
00:54:58.962 --> 00:55:00.047
I'll take care of it

815
00:55:00.130 --> 00:55:02.674
I will try my best to seek cooperation from other departments

816
00:55:02.758 --> 00:55:03.842
I'll go and

817
00:55:04.802 --> 00:55:05.969
Talk to the support team

818
00:55:06.595 --> 00:55:09.056
AI monitoring package and dedicated private network service...

819
00:55:09.139 --> 00:55:11.725
These guys still stick to their posts

820
00:55:12.267 --> 00:55:13.644
...succeeded in rebounding

821
00:55:14.186 --> 00:55:16.396
Fiscal austerity has been eased recently

822
00:55:16.480 --> 00:55:18.941
Tender volume for public institutions begins to expand again

823
00:55:19.441 --> 00:55:21.193
- That is to say...
- the only thing that changed

